WEBVTT - typo3-wcag22-aa-agentic (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.270
The European Accessibility Act is law. Checking every page by hand is slow.

2
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:18.468
You ask for every WCAG failure, page by page.

3
00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:25.732
Playwright and axe-core scan nine pages in twenty-nine states, in under a minute.

4
00:00:27.082 --> 00:00:33.312
The report lists each violation by page and drafts the accessibility statement.

5
00:00:34.362 --> 00:00:40.043
Scans are evidence, not a conformance claim. A person reviews the rest.

6
00:00:41.643 --> 00:00:44.529
Open source. Clone the skills.
